<h1>Invoice For Booking</h1>

<p>Payment ID: <%= transactionId %></p>
<p>Amount paid: $<%= totalAmount.toFixed(2) %></p>
<p>Tour: <%= tourTitle %></p>
<p>Booking Date: <%= bookingDate ? new Date(bookingDate).toDateString() : "N/A" %></p>

<p>Guest Name: <%= userName %> (Guests: <%= guestCount %>)</p>

<p>Thank you For Your Booking!</p>

<p><a>Download Invoice PDF</a></p>
